Parse this JSON text, which the program must hold as a string literal:

    {"users": [{"name": "ann", "age": 34}, {"name": "bo", "age": 25}]}

Print three lines from the parsed value, in this order:

1. how many users there are
2. the first user's name
3. the sum of all the users' ages

Print each with `.` followed by `cr`, so each line holds one value.
